    "created_at": "2025-02-03T08:29:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-03T08:29:14Z",
    "body": "\nUse any design tool (ie, Figma) and scrolling is allowed whilst dragging. This is incredibly important for web page builder tools.\n\nI'm not even sure what the workarounds are here, but this is very disappointing and hard to manage, given that there is no other way to listen to scroll wheel / trackpad events whilst dragging is occurring.",
